# The Day the Sky Fell Down — Father Thyme, v1.1 (ASL 600, Quest Viva re-save).
# No published walkthrough; route derived from the game source. "no" answers the
# sound-effects question. Laundry machine reveals the trolley; crate on trolley
# feeds Habitation (bottle -> Big Eva's brass key -> cubicles notice names driver
# JIG); trolley under The Measure triggers the Door. Ointment lets the rubble be
# searched (rock breaks the Vista mist); bronze key on the roof monster drops the
# tool box; footprints set the paint flag so Education can be entered; Old Creak's
# chalk exposes the stage panel; torch + grille readies the Door and drops the
# steel key (opens the box -> spanner). Scalpel scares the kobb off the medallion;
# gurney (name "Jig", medallion worn), spanner on the nut, button, joystick x5 ->
# dome. Branch lit with the case, building switch, screwdriver from the door,
# screwdriver on the carriage panel, then speak to the GODS and look at Sarge.
